<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Finally!\nI been up since... what day is it?\rYou know about my research?\nNo? Good. Don’t tell nobody.\rSee, these days everybody keep\ntheir homies in a Hood Ball.\rBut back in the day, people just\nwalked around WITH their homies.\fLike your lil homie Lyra do!\rHood Balls is great ’cause you can\ncarry a whole crew in your pocket.\rBut walkin’ with ’em? That gotta\ndo somethin’. I can FEEL it.\rMaybe it’s how they grow. Or\nevolve. Or... *scratches arm*\rSo I’ma give you a homie!\rWalk it around outside its\nHood Ball. See if y’all\fbond or whatever. I’ll take\fnotes. I don’t sleep anyway.\rThe machine over there got some\nhomies. Pick one. Quick. QUICK.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Finally!\nI been up since... what day is it?\rYou know about my research?\nNo? Good. Don’t tell nobody.\rSee, these days everybody keep\ntheir homies in a Hood Ball.\rBut back in the day, people just\nwalked around WITH their homies.\fLike your lil homie Ethan do!\rHood Balls is great ’cause you can\ncarry a whole crew in your pocket.\rBut walkin’ with ’em? That gotta\ndo somethin’. I can FEEL it.\rMaybe it’s how they grow. Or\nevolve. Or... *scratches arm*\rSo I’ma give you a homie!\rWalk it around outside its\nHood Ball. See if y’all\fbond or whatever. I’ll take\fnotes. I don’t sleep anyway.\rThe machine over there got some\nhomies. Pick one. Quick. QUICK.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Oh! Email! Is it my\nguy? Please be my guy.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: ...\nMm... Uh-huh... OK... OK OK OK...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Aight, listen.\nI got a guy. People call him\fMr. Pokémon.\rHe always findin’ weird stuff and\ncallin’ me at 4 AM about it.\rHe say this time it’s REAL.\nHe say that every time.\rProbably another Egg. But I’m\nreal busy. With... research.\fYeah. Research.\rWait!\nI got it!\rYou go for me, right?\nYou good for it?\rPick a homie off the machine.\nDon’t touch nothin’ else.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: If an opp jump out,\nlet your homie handle it! Don’t run!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Whoa, whoa! Where you\ngoin’? The homies in THAT machine.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\nfrom Professor Elm! Don’t ask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Give your {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\na street name? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 1, 0}? That’s\nwhat they goin’ by? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: How you like walkin’\nwith your homie? Hits different, huh?\rYou can take it all the way to\nMr. Pokémon’s spot.\rIf your homie gets hurt...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...patch it up on this machine.\rIt’s real easy. Just use the PC\non my desk. Don’t open the drawer.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Mr. Pokémon go\neverywhere and find rare stuff.\fHis spot is past Cherrygrove.\rGo north a lil past Cherrygrove.\fI’m countin’ on you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Hurry!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Mr. Pokémon go\neverywhere and find rare stuff.\fHis spot is past Cherrygrove.\rGo north a lil past Cherrygrove.\fI’m countin’ on you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Hurry!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This PC is hooked up to the\nhealing machine! And a scale.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s two homies left on the shelf!\n...But they Professor Elm’s.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s one homie left!\nYou ain’t notice before, but\fit’s behind bulletproof glass now.\fElm learned his lesson.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The shelf is empty...\rWho Elm give the last homie to?\nProbably sold it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Me?\nI ain’t the professor.\rHe in the back. Pacing.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, take these. Don’t ask\nwhere I got ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, take these. Don’t ask\nwhere I got ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homie weak at first.\rDon’t be shy with the Hennessy if\nthings get hot out there.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homie weak at first.\rDon’t be shy with the Hennessy if\nthings get hot out there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Freeze! Who are you?\nWe investigatin’ a stolen\fPokémon here...\rRule number one!\n“The one who did it always\fcome back to the scene.”\rOh snap... So it was...\nYOU?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Aye, hold up, officer!\nHe ain’t do nothin’!\rI seen it.\nIt was a red-headed kid\flurkin’ outside the lab!\rSnitches get... wait. Never mind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo, hold up, officer!\nShe ain’t do nothin’!\rI seen it.\nIt was a red-headed kid\flurkin’ outside the lab!\rSnitches get... wait. Never mind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What?\nYou threw hands with a kid like that?\rHe gotta be the one...\nYou get his name?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got it. So {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} is\nhis name. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thanks for snitchin’... I mean,\nhelpin’ the investigation!\rNext I’ma find this red-headed kid.\nOr get donuts. Probably donuts.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That ain’t it?\rThen what was his name?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nGlad 12 knows you innocent.\fThis time.\rStay dangerous, pimp!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nGlad 12 knows you innocent.\fThis time.\rStay dangerous!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, this is\nBAD... somebody took my stuff...\rI mean my Pokémon. Pokémon.\nWhat was Mr. Pokémon’s big thing?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, this is\nBAD... somebody took my stuff...\rI mean my Pokémon. Pokémon.\nWhat was Mr. Pokémon’s big thing?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed the Mystery Egg\nto Professor Elm.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Huh?\nIt’s an...Egg. Just a Egg?\rI was promised somethin’ bigger.\nThis just a Egg.\rMr. Pokémon always geekin’\nover Eggs.\rWell, he gave it to us, so we\nmight as well see what’s in it.\rI’ma hold onto it for a while.\nI’ll be up anyway.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: WHAT?!\rProfessor Oak gave you a Pokédex?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, for real? Th-that’s\ncrazy! I owe that man money!\rHe good at seein’ who got\nthat dog in ’em.\rWow, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nI knew you was different.\fThis finna be fun!\rYour homies love you, so why\ndon’t you...take over the\fblocks?\rIf you take down every Block Boss,\nyou can run up on the\fBig League and the\fKingpin!\r...Or not! Haha! Ha. Hah.\rBeing Kingpin ain’t easy,\nbut you can definitely\fstart with Violet City’s block.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: WHAT?!\rProfessor Oak gave you a Pokédex?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, for real? Th-that’s\ncrazy! I owe that man money!\rHe good at seein’ who got\nthat dog in ’em.\rWow, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nI knew you was different.\fThis finna be fun!\rYour homies love you, so why\ndon’t you...take over the\fblocks?\rIf you take down every Block Boss,\nyou can run up on the\fBig League and the\fKingpin!\r...Or not! Haha! Ha. Hah.\rBeing Kingpin ain’t easy,\nbut you can definitely\fstart with Violet City’s block.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. Takin’ over\nall them blocks gon’ be\fa long road.\rBefore you leave, go talk to your\nmama. She worry. I worry. I’m fine.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. Takin’ over\nall them blocks gon’ be\fa long road.\rBefore you leave, go talk to your\nmama. She worry. I worry. I’m fine.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Don’t give up! I’ll\ncall you at 3 AM about that Egg!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There was a loud noise outside...\nWhen we went to look, somebody\fstole a Pokémon.\rSigh...\nAnd Elm’s “vitamins” too.\rI wonder how it’s doin’.\nThey say a homie raised by an opp\fturns into an opp.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nYou ain’t meet my assistant?\rHe was supposed to meet you with\nthe Egg at Violet City’s Corner Store.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nYou ain’t meet my assistant?\rHe was supposed to meet you with\nthe Egg at Violet City’s Corner Store.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou good? I’m good. I’m great.\rHow the Egg doin’?\nYou keepin’ it on you?\rTime and love gon’ hatch it\ninto a healthy\flil homie! Unlike me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou good? I’m good. I’m great.\rHow the Egg doin’?\nYou keepin’ it on you?\rTime and love gon’ hatch it\ninto a healthy\flil homie! Unlike me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: WHAT?\nTHAT homie?!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\nI ain’t never seen nothin’\flike this in Johto...\rJust like Mr. Pokémon said\non the phone at 4 AM...\rThe legendary Pokémon might be...\nNah. Forget I said that.\rAnyway, stuff always be\nhappenin’ around you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou got me all hyped!\nI’ma give you somethin’.\fTake it. Before I change my mind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\nI ain’t never seen nothin’\flike this in Johto...\rJust like Mr. Pokémon said\non the phone at 4 AM...\rThe legendary Pokémon might be...\nNah. Forget I said that.\rAnyway, stuff always be\nhappenin’ around you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou got me all hyped!\nI’ma give you somethin’.\fTake it. Before I change my mind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: That’s an Everstone.\rHomies glow up when\nthey evolve.\rBut if they holdin’ an Everstone,\nthey stay the same. Forever.\rLike me since ’09.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, good luck\nout there!\rOh, one more thing...\nDon’t forget my research! Or my money!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, good luck\nout there!\rOh, one more thing...\nDon’t forget my research! Or my money!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Bag is full. Like Elm’s pockets.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nI thought the Egg hatched.\fWhere the homie at?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nI thought the Egg hatched.\fWhere the homie at?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sigh...\nThat stolen Pokémon.\rI wonder how it’s doin’.\nThey say a homie raised by an opp\fturns into an opp.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nGuess what!\rThe kid who stole the Professor’s\nhomie...came back to return it!\rI did NOT see that comin’!\nGuess what Elm told him.\r...\n“Looks like your homie already\fride for you.\rA homie’s happiest with\nsomebody who love it.\fKeep it. And keep your mouth shut.”\r...\nAin’t that beautiful? I cried!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The kid who took it...\nthe red-headed one\fbrought the homie back.\rBut I seen his face when he\nwalked by. He was smilin’. Creepy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Aye pimp! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou already got eight chains?\fThat’s hard!\rThe professor waitin’ on you.\nHe ain’t blinked in a while.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou already got eight chains?\fThat’s hard!\rThe professor waitin’ on you.\nHe ain’t blinked in a while.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou keep doin’ the impossible!\rThanks to you, my research is\ngoin’ GREAT! I’m so awake!\rTake this, as a token of my\nappreciation.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou keep doin’ the impossible!\rThanks to you, my research is\ngoin’ GREAT! I’m so awake!\rTake this, as a token of my\nappreciation.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The OG Ball is the best!\rIt’s the ultimate Hood Ball! It’ll\nrecruit ANY Pokémon. No questions.\rThey only give ’em to real\nresearchers. Like me. Allegedly.\rYou’ll use it better than me,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. I’d sell it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The OG Ball is the best!\rIt’s the ultimate Hood Ball! It’ll\nrecruit ANY Pokémon. No questions.\rThey only give ’em to real\nresearchers. Like me. Allegedly.\rYou’ll use it better than me,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. I’d sell it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way...\rSome fine Kimono Girls\ncame by lookin’ for you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way...\rSome fine Kimono Girls\ncame by lookin’ for you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Kimono Girls said they\nwaitin’ on you at the Ecruteak\fDance Theater.\rI know you been through a lot since\nthat Egg got you caught up\fin all this...\rStay solid.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, the whole hood\ntalkin’ about you!\rYou helped the Kimono Girls?\rYou out here helpin’ everybody!\nYou make me proud to be your homie.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, the whole hood\ntalkin’ about you!\rYou helped the Kimono Girls?\rYou out here helpin’ everybody!\nYou make me proud to be your homie.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: The Kimono Girls\nwaitin’ on you at the\fEcruteak Dance Theater.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Hahaha... Good job!\rThat rare Egg brought you\nnothin’ but drama, huh?\rThe Kimono Girls said somethin’\nabout me?\fI don’t know them. Never met ’em.\rYou made your own choices\nand you stood on ’em.\rAfter all that, you ready to\ntake on the Big League now!\rHead to the\nIndigo Plateau!\rYou know how to get there?\nFollow Route 27 to Route 26.\fThen go straight north. Don’t stop.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThere you go!\rI called ’cause I got somethin’\nfor you.\rSee? It’s an S.S. Ticket.\nNow you can recruit in Kanto.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThere you go!\rI called ’cause I got somethin’\nfor you.\rSee? It’s an S.S. Ticket.\nNow you can recruit in Kanto.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: The Ticket gets you\non the Fast Ship that leaves\ffrom Olivine City.\rBut you knew that,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rYou been all over with\nyour homies.\rTell Professor Oak I said wassup.\nAnd that I’ll pay him back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: The Ticket gets you\non the Fast Ship that leaves\ffrom Olivine City.\rBut you knew that,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rYou been all over with\nyour homies.\rTell Professor Oak I said wassup.\nAnd that I’ll pay him back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: That’s a real\nrare PICHU!\fLemme look at it real close...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\nOne ear is spiky...\fThat’s weird.\fSomethin’ else goin’ on here.\rThat’s a rare sight. Like me sober.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found it in Ilex Forest?\rA mysterious Pokémon called CELEBI\nbeen seen out there, or so I heard.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Speakin’ of that...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak once wrote about\nCELEBI and {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0} in a paper\fhe read at a conference, high!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: CELEBI can use its\nmystic power called {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0}...to\fgo to the past and future.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If this PICHU been through\ntime, you should keep\fa close eye on it, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rLooks like this PICHU got\nmessed up from goin’ so far\fthrough time with CELEBI.\rI’ll let the Trap House know.\rThe lady at the front should be\nable to tell you what’s up\fwith that PICHU.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If this PICHU been through\ntime, you should keep\fa close eye on it, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rLooks like this PICHU got\nmessed up from goin’ so far\fthrough time with CELEBI.\rI’ll let the Trap House know.\rThe lady at the front should be\nable to tell you what’s up\fwith that PICHU.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: This PICHU ain’t\nlike a regular PICHU.\fI’ma look into it. All night.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh wow, your Spiky-eared PICHU\nreally rock with you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh wow, your Spiky-eared PICHU\nreally rock with you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somethin’ off...\nIt shoulda glowed up into\fPIKACHU since it love you\fthis much...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme see...\rHmm...\rCould it be...\rJust like I thought!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This PICHU ain’t never gon’\nevolve. That’s so weird!\rIts body and the time travel\nmust’ve messed with\fits DNA.\rI ain’t never heard of a homie\nthat don’t glow up when\fit’s supposed to...!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Your Spiky-eared PICHU\nlookin’ just fine!\rI ain’t never heard of a homie\nthat don’t glow up when\fit’s supposed to.\fTake care of it. Seriously.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna patch up\nyour homies? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} opened a book.\rStreet Tip 1: Tap the A Button\nicon on the Touch Screen.\rYou can check stuff, talk to people,\nall that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} opened a book.\rStreet Tip 2: Your Trainer Card is\nyour ID. Don’t let nobody\ftake it. Unlike your dad’s.\rSave your progress with SAVE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} opened a book.\rStreet Tip 3: Everything in your Bag\nis sorted. Unlike Elm’s desk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} opened a book.\rStreet Tip 4: The Pokégear is\nmad useful.\rYou can call people,\nlisten to the radio, check the map,\fall that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found a note...\nIf a homie is tryna glow up,\fyou can stop it.\rPress the B Button during evolution.\nAlso: “call the guy. 3 AM.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou good?\rYou could be the next\nKingpin after takin’ care of\fthat Egg!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou good?\rYou could be the next\nKingpin after takin’ care of\fthat Egg!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d love to see the homie\nthat hatched out\fthat Egg, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d love to see the homie\nthat hatched out\fthat Egg, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nI’m SHOOK!\rI can’t believe a legend\nlike you been livin’ next\fdoor this whole time!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you taught me\nwhat it really mean to\fride with your homies.\rIt’s that...\fthe bond between people and\fPokémon don’t never end!\rThank you again. For real.\nI’m gon’ go lay down for once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nI’m SHOOK!\rI can’t believe a legend\nlike you been livin’ next\fdoor this whole time!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you taught me\nwhat it really mean to\fride with your homies.\rIt’s that...\fthe bond between people and\fPokémon don’t never end!\rThank you again. For real.\nI’m gon’ go lay down for once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00104" index="104">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\nI ain’t never seen nothin’\flike this in Johto...\rJust like Mr. Pokémon said\non the phone at 4 AM.\rStuff always be happenin’\nwhen you around,\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou got me all hyped!\nI’ma give you somethin’.\fTake it. Before I change my mind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00105" index="105">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\nI ain’t never seen nothin’\flike this in Johto...\rJust like Mr. Pokémon said\non the phone at 4 AM.\rStuff always be happenin’\nwhen you around,\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou got me all hyped!\nI’ma give you somethin’.\fTake it. Before I change my mind.\r</language>
